This  includes  CD, DVD, and Blu‐Ray (BD) media.  The options are
as follows: Blank media when possible before formatting it.   Ex‐
plicitly  select  packet size in sectors It is not recommended to
change this from its default of 32.  Certify media for DVD‐RAM  /
